    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Tree DFS</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Bottom-up</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/diameter-of-binary-tree/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 543</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Diameter of Binary Tree</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Every path has one highest node where it bends, and the longest path bending at a node is height(left) + height(right). Compute heights bottom-up and keep the best bend seen anywhere; return the height upward, record the bend on the side. O(n) time, O(h) stack.</p>\n"
